---
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import PolaroidRow from '../components/PolaroidRow.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
	title={`About | ${site.name}`}
	description={`${site.name}’s path into software, approach to teamwork, and life outside work in Virginia Beach.`}
>
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero title="About" tagline="The person behind the computer." />

			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>How I got here</h2>
				<div class="content" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
					<p>
						I’ve loved Apple products for as long as I can remember. I’ve owned every iPhone except
						the very first one, so it’s probably no surprise I ended up building apps for them.
					</p>
					<p>
						I didn’t start out in tech, though. I began college studying Intelligence Analysis, and
						along the way I realized I could pair my communication and presentation skills with
						programming. I wanted to be an engineer who could also explain, present, and lead, so I
						switched to Computer Science at James Madison University.
					</p>
					<p>
						Two summers at NASA Langley sealed it. One of my favorite memories is soldering a
						temperature sensor onto a fixed-wing drone, then watching it stream live engine
						temperatures back to us while it flew.
					</p>
					<p>
						From there I spent three years at Capital One, then went deep on native iOS at Addepar,
						Fliff, and now Toast.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Why mobile</h2>
				<div class="content" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
					<p>
						I love building for the device people carry everywhere.
					</p>
					<p>
						Native mobile has challenges you don’t find anywhere else: form factors, app performance,
						battery life, privacy, and releases you can’t just roll back. That’s what makes it fun. And every
						June and September feel like the holidays, with WWDC, new SDKs, and new products to dig into.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>How I work</h2>
				<div class="content" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
					<p>
						I’m collaborative and low-ego, and I get more out of seeing teammates succeed than out
						of my own wins. Great software is a team effort, and I like bringing everyone along for
						the ride, whether that’s sharing context, presenting an idea, or building tools that
						make everyone’s day a little easier.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Outside work</h2>
				<div class="content" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
					<p>
						I was born and raised in Virginia Beach, and a couple of years into my career I moved
						back to be close to family. Most of my free time goes to playing with my kids and
						spending time with my wife.
					</p>
					<p>
						My job keeps me at a computer, so I make up for it outside: long-distance and endurance
						running, downhill mountain biking, snowboarding, and just about any sport or activity I
						can find.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
			<div class="photos">
				<PolaroidRow
					entrance="burst"
					photos={[
						{ caption: 'Best coworker', photo: '/assets/about/desk.jpg' },
						{ caption: 'Aquarium days', photo: '/assets/about/aquarium.jpg' },
						{ caption: 'Bike rides', photo: '/assets/about/bikes.jpg' },
						{ caption: 'Pony rides', photo: '/assets/about/horse.jpg' },
						{ caption: 'Time outside', photo: '/assets/about/trail.jpg' },
					]}
				/>
			</div>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	.photos {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
		max-width: 65ch;
	}

	.content > :global(p + p) {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		.photos {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
